<title>LATVIA: TRASTA SIX-MONTH PROFIT 725,160 LATS.</title>
<headline>TRASTA SIX-MONTH PROFIT 725,160 LATS.</headline>
<dateline>RIGA 1997-07-07</dateline>
<text>
<p>Trasta komercbanka said on Monday that its profit in the first six months of the year was 725,160 lats and that the profit in the month of June was 102,433 lats.</p>
<p>&quot;The profit in the first six months has already beaten that of last year, which was 684,256 lats,&quot; the bank said in a statement.</p>
<p>It said that most of its profit came from securities operations and commissions for bank services.</p>
<p>It said that its return on equity was 56.7 percent and return on assets 7.3 percent.</p>
<p>Its assets at the end of June were 30.73 million lats versus 19.84 million lats at the end of 1996.</p>
<p>-- Patrick Lannin, Riga newsroom, +371 721 5240</p>
</text>
